## CONTROL Break Algorithm (Pseudo-code)

```
DetectAndProcessControlBreak(reportName, detailName):
  breakLevel = -1
  for i = 0 to numControlLevels-1:
    if CurrentControl[i] != PriorControl[i]:
      breakLevel = i
      break  // Stop at first differing level

  if breakLevel >= 0:
    // Save current values
    saved = { CurrentControl[i] for i >= breakLevel }
    // Restore priors
    for i = breakLevel to numControlLevels-1:
      CurrentControl[i] = PriorControl[i]
    // Print FOOTINGs (minor→major, i.e., from highest i down to breakLevel)
    for i = numControlLevels-1 down to breakLevel:
      PrintControlFooting(i)
    // Print HEADINGs (major→minor, i.e., from breakLevel up to numControlLevels-1)
    for i = breakLevel to numControlLevels-1:
      PrintControlHeading(i)
    // Update priors for levels >= breakLevel
    for i = breakLevel to numControlLevels-1:
      PriorControl[i] = saved[i]
    // Restore current values
    CurrentControl[i] = saved[i]
```

## Grammar (CobolReportWriter.g4 + CobolParserCore.g4)

### New Grammar Rules

**CobolReportWriter.g4 additions:**
```g4
// Enhance reportGroupClause for SOURCE, SUM, PRESENT WHEN, GROUP INDICATE
reportGroupClause
    : reportTypeClause
    | reportSumClause
    | reportSourceClause
    | reportPresentWhenClause
    | reportGroupIndicateClause
    | reportNextGroupClause
    | reportCodeClause
    | reportColumnClause
    | reportValueClause
    | genericReportGroupClause
    ;

reportSourceClause
    : SOURCE IS dataReference
    ;

reportPresentWhenClause
    : PRESENT WHEN condition
    ;

reportGroupIndicateClause
    : GROUP INDICATE
    ;

reportNextGroupClause
    : NEXT GROUP (PLUS integerLiteral | integerLiteral | NEXT PAGE (WITH RESET)?)
    ;

reportCodeClause
    : CODE IS? (integerLiteral | dataReference)
    ;

reportColumnClause
    : COLUMN NUMBER IS? integerLiteral
    ;

reportValueClause
    : VALUE IS? (literal | figurativeConstant)
    ;

// Enhance RD entry for LINAGE, CONTROL, VARYING, CODE, PAGE clauses
reportDescriptionClause
    : genericClause
    | LINAGE IS? integerLiteral LINES? (HEADING integerLiteral)? (FIRST DETAIL integerLiteral)? (LAST DETAIL integerLiteral)? (FOOTING integerLiteral)?
    | CONTROL IS? (FINAL | dataReference)+
    | VARYING dataReference FROM arithmeticExpression BY arithmeticExpression
    | CODE IS? (integerLiteral | dataReference)
    | PAGE LIMIT IS? integerLiteral
    ;
```

**CobolParserCore.g4 statement dispatcher addition (line 445-491):**
```g4
statement
    : ... existing statements ...
    | initiateStatement
    | generateStatement
    | terminateStatement
    | suppressStatement
    ;

initiateStatement
    : INITIATE reportName+
    ;

generateStatement
    : GENERATE (dataReference | reportName)  // dataReference=detail group or reportName for summary
    ;

terminateStatement
    : TERMINATE reportName+
    ;

suppressStatement
    : SUPPRESS PRINTING
    ;
```

**USE statement enhancement (CobolControlFlow.g4):**
```g4
useStatement
    : USE BEFORE REPORTING reportGroupName declarativeBody
    | USE (AFTER | ON) errorPhraseFormat declarativeBody
    ;

reportGroupName
    : dataReference  // qualified detail/group name
    ;

declarativeBody
    : sentence*  // SUPPRESS, USE procedures, etc.
